<title>POLAND: Animex sees 1997 net up to PLN 17.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Animex sees 1997 net up to PLN 17.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food producer and trader Animex SA expects to lift its 1997 net profit to 17.2 million zlotys from last year's unaudited 14.7 million, the company's president said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Witold Pereta said the company expected its sales to grow to 650 million zlotys from 476.4 million in 1996.</p>
<p>Pereta also said the company's 1996 net profit was likely to be revised up after the audit to between 15 and 16 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
